    "description": "Payment facilitators, known in Persian as pardakht-yar companies, provide an intermediary layer between merchants and payment service providers in Iran. Their services can simplify gateway integration, but their commercial offerings must be distinguished from verified regulatory permissions and settlement arrangements.",
    "tags": ["Payment facilitators", "Pardakht-yar", "Merchant payments", "Payment gateways", "Fintech"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
    "as_of_date": "2026-10-26",
